@tag('Status/Draft')
Dashboard vplus_report_extract {
  title: 'V+ Report Extract'
  description: 'Source table for the automated V+ post-report deck. One wide table at day x ad x property attributes x screen location x demographic grain, with the governed campaign and network benchmarks broadcast onto every row, plus a one-row totals table for reconciliation. The deck pipeline exports v_report for the selected campaign id (Direct) or ad ids (Programmatic) and derives every slide from it.'
  owner: 'ganonuevo@verticalcity.com'

  // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // One control, sourced from the attention_base.report_filter PARAM. It takes one campaign id
  // (Direct) or several ad ids (Programmatic). The param clips attention_base to the flight window;
  // the block condition `filter_model.report_filter in attention_base.report_filter` carries the
  // same values through the network scope chain. There is no empty-control fallback on purpose:
  // the extract must always be scoped to a selection.
  // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  block f_report: FilterBlock {
    label: 'Campaign ID (Direct) or Ad IDs (Programmatic)'
    type: 'field'
    source: FieldFilterSource {
      dataset: attention
      field: r(attention_base.report_filter)
    }
    default {
      operator: 'is'
      value: ['10605']
    }
    settings {
      input_type: 'multiple'
    }
  }

  block t_intro: TextBlock {
    content: @md
## V+ report extract

**v_report** is the single source for the automated post-report deck. Each row is one bucket of the selected campaign's own events (`campaign_datapoints`, `campaign_attention_seconds_sum`) and carries the governed benchmarks as columns: the campaign average, the network average, and the network averages by gender, by age group and by gender x age. The pipeline exports this table and derives every slide (gender, age, city, province, FSA, property type, creatives, over time, top demographic) by summing `campaign_attention_seconds_sum / campaign_datapoints` at the grain it needs. Active attention is the share of rows whose exposure category is Message Exposure (2.5 s and above).

**v_totals** is the reconciliation row: the pipeline asserts that its own roll-up of v_report equals these governed numbers before it builds anything.

Validation baseline, campaign 10605: 32,156 datapoints, campaign average 5.199657, network average 5.233177, window Aug 12 to Oct 1 2026.
    ;;
  }

  block v_totals: VizBlock {
    label: 'Governed totals (reconciliation row)'
    viz: DataTable {
      dataset: attention
      filter {
        field: r(attention_base.is_in_flight_range)
        operator: 'is'
        value: true
      }
      conditions: [
        'filter_model.report_filter in attention_base.report_filter'
      ]
      fields: [
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(attention.campaign_datapoints)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(attention.campaign_attention_seconds_sum)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(attention.campaign_average_attention_seconds)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(attention.campaign_screens)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(attention.attention_events)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(attention.network_average_overall)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(attention.attention_vs_network)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(attention.selected_campaign_start_date)
          format {
            type: 'date'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(attention.selected_campaign_end_date)
          format {
            type: 'date'
          }
        }
      ]
      settings {
        show_row_number: false
        row_limit: 100
      }
    }
  }

  block v_report: VizBlock {
    label: 'Report extract (day x ad x property x screen location x demographic, with benchmarks)'
    viz: DataTable {
      dataset: attention
      filter {
        field: r(attention_base.is_in_flight_range)
        operator: 'is'
        value: true
      }
      conditions: [
        'filter_model.report_filter in attention_base.report_filter'
      ]
      fields: [
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(attention_base.start_date_local)
          format {
            type: 'date'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(attention_base.ad_id)
          format {
            type: 'text'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(attention_base.ads_type)
          format {
            type: 'text'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(creative_img.media_type)
          format {
            type: 'text'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(creative_img.creative_img)
          format {
            type: 'text'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(attention_base.ad_length_grouped)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(attention_base.city)
          format {
            type: 'text'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(properties.address_province)
          format {
            type: 'text'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(properties.fsa)
          format {
            type: 'text'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(properties.property_type_broad)
          format {
            type: 'text'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(properties.property_type)
          format {
            type: 'text'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(screens.screen_location)
          format {
            type: 'text'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(attention_base.gender)
          format {
            type: 'text'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(attention_base.age_group)
          format {
            type: 'text'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(attention_base.exposure_category)
          format {
            type: 'text'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(attention.campaign_datapoints)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(attention.campaign_attention_seconds_sum)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(attention.campaign_average_attention_seconds)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(attention.network_average_overall)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(attention.network_average_by_gender)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(attention.network_average_by_age_group)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(attention.network_average_by_gender_age)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        }
      ]
      settings {
        show_row_number: false
        row_limit: 500000
      }
    }
  }

  // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // Delivery facts from dataset vplus_delivery (flights + plays_summary), kept apart from the
  // attention dataset. Same selection semantics: campaign id (Direct) or ad ids (Programmatic).
  // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  block f_delivery: FilterBlock {
    label: 'Delivery: Campaign ID (Direct)'
    type: 'field'
    source: FieldFilterSource {
      dataset: vplus_delivery
      field: r(vplus_served_impressions.campaign_id)
    }
    default {
      operator: 'is'
      value: ['10605']
    }
    settings {
      input_type: 'multiple'
    }
  }

  block f_delivery_ads: FilterBlock {
    label: 'Delivery: Ad IDs (Programmatic, optional)'
    type: 'field'
    source: FieldFilterSource {
      dataset: vplus_delivery
      field: r(vplus_served_impressions.ad_id)
    }
    settings {
      input_type: 'multiple'
    }
  }

  block v_delivery: VizBlock {
    label: 'Campaign delivery (Looker flights_summary measures over the selected flights)'
    viz: DataTable {
      dataset: vplus_delivery
      fields: [
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_delivery.flight_count)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_delivery.flight_start)
          format {
            type: 'date'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_delivery.flight_end)
          format {
            type: 'date'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_delivery.booked_impressions)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_delivery.flight_actual_impressions)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_delivery.served_impressions)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_delivery.bonus_impressions)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_delivery.total_contract_cost)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_delivery.rate_card_value)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_delivery.bonus_value)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_delivery.cpm)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
      ]
      settings {
        show_row_number: false
        row_limit: 100
      }
    }
  }

  block v_flights: VizBlock {
    label: 'Flights behind the selection (raw_campaigns rows)'
    viz: DataTable {
      dataset: vplus_delivery
      fields: [
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_flight_facts.campaign_id)
          format {
            type: 'text'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_flight_facts.campaign_name)
          format {
            type: 'text'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_flight_facts.report_code)
          format {
            type: 'text'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_flight_facts.campaign_type)
          format {
            type: 'text'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_flight_facts.status)
          format {
            type: 'text'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_flight_facts.flight_start)
          format {
            type: 'date'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_flight_facts.flight_end)
          format {
            type: 'date'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_flight_facts.ad_duration)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_flight_facts.booked_impressions)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_flight_facts.actual_impressions)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_flight_facts.contract_cost)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_flight_facts.rate)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_flight_facts.actual_value)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(vplus_flight_facts.booked_value)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: 'inherited'
          }
        },
      ]
      settings {
        show_row_number: false
        row_limit: 1000
      }
